<title>USA: U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on April 22.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on April 22.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget statement.</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				April 22	     April 21</p>
<p>Fed acct			14.137		  6.777</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	  27.665		 35.183</p>
<p>Cash balance		  41.802		 41.960</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Total public debt,</p>
<p> subject to limit	5,254.303	     5,266.644</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Treasury said individual income tax refunds valued at $4 million were issued and $290 million of corporate refunds were issued.</p>
